WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.580
I'm the farthest human-made object.

2
00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:14.060
In 1990 I turned around and took a picture of Earth — a pale blue dot in a sunbeam.

3
00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:20.360
In 2012 I left the Sun's bubble and entered interstellar space.

4
00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:28.440
My instruments are being switched off one by one to save power, but I'm still listening and still talking.

5
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:33.580
The farthest you have ever reached, still saying hello.
